    "description": "<p>This repository contains <code>Ogham Data</code> of several data sources such as</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Celtic Inscribed Stones Project (CISP)</li>\n\t<li>Ogham in 3D Project</li>\n\t<li>Corpus inscriptionum insularum Celticarum (1945)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The data is divided into</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Geospatial Data</li>\n\t<li>Ogham Data</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The data belongs to the <a href=\"http://ogham.squirrel.link/\"><code>Irish ᚑᚌᚆᚐᚋ Stones in the Wikimedia Universe</code></a> project. This project is funded by <code>Wikimedia Deutschland</code> and the <code>Open Science Fellows Program</code>.</p>",
